WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Sofia Alvarez: We're proposing a small refresh to the brand guidelines, mainly around the secondary color palette.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rachel Kim: Does this affect any in-flight campaign assets?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Sofia Alvarez: Only the mid-market expansion campaign, which hasn't gone to design production yet.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Sofia Alvarez: I'll make sure that campaign uses the updated guidelines once they're approved.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Rachel Kim: Let's get final sign-off by the end of the week so we don't delay the campaign.
